{"title": "Shield Master: Block", "pageid": 21510, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shield_Master:_Block", "categories": ["Class actions", "Reactions", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shield_Master_Block.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Shield_Master_Block.webp/300px-Shield_Master_Block.webp, /w/images/6/62/Shield_Master_Block.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Shield_Master_Block.webp/300px-Shield_Master_Block.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Shield_Master_Block.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Shield Master: Block</b> is a reaction/passive feature obtained by selecting the <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Master\" title=\"Shield Master\">Shield Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a>. It negates damage from many area of effect attacks on a successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spell</a> forces you to make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup>, you can use your <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to shield yourself and diminish the effect's damage.\n</p>\nOn a failed save, you only take half damage<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>. On a successful save, you don't take any damage, even if you normally would.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_ShieldBlow</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_ShieldBlow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_ShieldBlow\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Reaction</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">ShieldMaster_Block</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ShieldMaster_Block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ShieldMaster_Block\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Passive feature which grants the reaction</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Master_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield Master (Feat)\">Shield Master (Feat)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description of this feature, it does not matter whether an action has a Dexterity saving throw or whether it is a spell. As a rule of thumb, explosions which involve a Dexterity saving throw can be blocked (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/20px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/40px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fireball\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/20px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a> but not <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame\" title=\"Sacred Flame\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/20px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/30px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/40px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacred Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/20px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame\" title=\"Sacred Flame\">Sacred Flame</a> which does use a Dexterity saving throw but involves a single target). However, this is not true of every such explosion and there are actions without Dexterity saving throws which can also be blocked (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Breath\" title=\"Frost Breath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Breath_Icon.webp/20px-Frost_Breath_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Breath_Icon.webp/30px-Frost_Breath_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Breath_Icon.webp/40px-Frost_Breath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frost Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Breath_Icon.webp/20px-Frost_Breath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Frost_Breath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Breath\" title=\"Frost Breath\">Frost Breath</a> which uses a Constitution saving throw). Refer to <a href=\"/wiki/CanAreaDamageEvade_(spell_flag)#List_of_actions_with_CanAreaDamageEvade\" title=\"CanAreaDamageEvade (spell flag)\">this table</a> for a comprehensive list of actions which can be blocked with this feature.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This passive provides no effect on a failed save.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2621/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29238/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13333/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1454284/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.630      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   57.630      1 -total\n 87.72%   50.551     33 Template:Trim\n 26.01%   14.987      6 Template:Icon_text\n 20.82%   11.998      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.34%    8.264      1 Template:Saving_throw\n 14.17%    8.168      6 Template:Ifempty\n 13.10%    7.551      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.30%    7.091      3 Template:SmSAI\n  9.76%    5.624      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21510-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034846 and revision id 387763. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}